      <p>I'm the <strong>first person in my family to go to college</strong>, and I'm studying computer science at UC San Diego.</p>
      <p>I got into coding in 6th grade, when I started making an app in Xcode. From there, I learned JavaScript and got into more creative coding.</p>
      <p>I'm not sure yet what I want to build next, but I know I want it to be meaningful and to contribute to a large project.</p>
